</mxCell>
<mxCell id="73" value="&lt;b&gt;EXPLANATORY NOTE 5: INVOICING, DRAFTS, AND DOCUMENT DELIVERY&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Invoicing Format:&lt;/b&gt; Invoices are primarily handled digitally via email using soft copies. However, if a client specifically requires a physical hard copy, they are dispatched on a &lt;b&gt;monthly basis&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Draft Approvals:&lt;/b&gt; For multi-location agent clients who frequently need address adjustments or revisions, draft invoices are shared for approval within &lt;b&gt;24 hours&lt;/b&gt; to minimize later rework.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Timeline Targets:&lt;/b&gt; The core performance target is to successfully raise and dispatch the final invoice within &lt;b&gt;two days&lt;/b&gt; of shipment execution." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffdf5;strokeColor=#f59e0b;fontColor=#1c1917;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;align=left;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
  <mxGeometry x="900" y="1550" width="840" height="190" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="74" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;strokeColor=#f59e0b;strokeWidth=1;dashed=1;endArrow=oval;endFill=1;startArrow=none;" edge="1" source="61" target="73" parent="1">
